----INTRA-PROTEIN CONTACT MATRIX FOR CYTOSOLIC STATE-----

This directory contains the raw matrices generated by fast_cont_mat.py in three folders.
    i) preLC3B_OPLS_SIM1_dt1000_cont_mat (Replica 1)
    ii) preLC3B_OPLS_SIM2_dt1000_cont_mat (Replica 2)
    iii) preLC3B_OPLS_SIM3_dt1000_cont_mat (Replica 3)
The merged csv files are generated with cont_map_maker.py for each replicate
    i) preLC3B_OPLS_SIM1_dt1000_cont_mat.csv (Replica 1)
    ii) preLC3B_OPLS_SIM2_dt1000_cont_mat.csv (Replica 2)
    iii) preLC3B_OPLS_SIM3_dt1000_cont_mat.csv (Replica 3)

Finally, the consensus contact matrix from three replicated generated using consensus_cont_mat_maker.py is saved as preLC3B_new_all_sims_consensus_cont_mat.csv